Package: MaMaMIA
Title: Max Mapping for Meticulous Introgression Analysis
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aleksey", "Ermolaev", email = "alerm@al-erm.ru", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9789-8694")),
    person("Daniil", "Ulyanov", email = "uldas1508@gmail.com", role = "aut")
    )
Description: The MaMaMIA provides a workflow for rough and rapid interspecific introgression detection in Genotyping-by-Sequencing (GBS) mapping data. It integrates BAM ingestion, GC-bias correction, pairwise chromosome comparison, and coverage depth profile segmentation to identify introgressed segments.
